 "remarks": "Welcome to NEW CONSTRUCTION on West Cedar Street in Norwalk, CT. Choose from one- and two-bedroom apartments, plus two townhomes with two bedrooms and one and a half baths. Every home has luxury vinyl plank floors throughout, plenty of windows for natural light and in-unit laundry. Ample cabinet/closet space + individual storage areas per unit. Light & Bright with recessed lighting throughout for a modern vibe. Natural Gas, Central Air Cooling & New Insulation keep the utilities LOW! The VIEWStastic rooftop gives the community a place to gather and relax. Each residence comes with one reserved parking space in parking garage. Professional landscaping with plenty of curb appeal. Commuters Dream! The central location puts you close to shopping along Connecticut Avenue, public transportation including the train station, and quick access to I-95. Good credit, proof of income & references are a MUST! * This unit includes 2 garage parking spaces & a separate storage area*",
